  "safetyLog": [
    {
      "date": "Jul 29, 2026",
      "shortDesc": "⚠️ PSE — dropped chain fall, 7HA.03 exhaust frame rigging",
      "desc": "Official findings — 7HA.03 exhaust frame rigging, July 29, 2026. While clearing rigging after the exhaust frame was set, a 3/4-inch wire rope caught on a stud on the mini case as the lifting team cabled up, causing the rope to snap. The break dropped a 10T chain fall to the turbine deck. No injuries. The signal person, positioned atop the compressor turbine shell about 10 feet from the rigging, did not see the wire rope snag the stud. The overhead crane operator had no direct visibility of the rigging and continued cabling up based on the signal person's calls, adding tension to the snagged rope until it failed. Corrective actions: visually confirm all rigging is clear of any snag point before any crane movement; do not proceed without secondary verification that rigging is clear; stop work if rigging isn't moving freely during clearing and cable-up; secure and bag all pull chains before crane movement; establish a secondary exclusion zone to protect against a potential rigging failure."
    },
    {
      "date": "Jul 24, 2026",
      "shortDesc": "🛑 Stop Work — damaged sling caught before rotor lift",
      "desc": "7HA.03 Project Crew — Damaged sling discovered while unloading the rotor beam from the hook to the lifting beam. Sling immediately tagged out of service; no equivalent-rated sling available onsite, so a replacement was rented locally in Houston. Lift completed on schedule with no further delay."
    },
    {
      "date": "Jul 5, 2026",
      "shortDesc": "🛑 Stop Work — barricade correction, 7FH2 rotor",
      "desc": "Submitted by Ben Smith — LV 26-1 class was performing live electrical testing on the 7FH2 rotor without barricades. Work was stopped and the team coached on proper barricade placement to protect the testing area before work resumed."
    },
    {
      "date": "Apr 3, 2026",
      "shortDesc": "Lube oil spill — contained",
      "desc": "Lube oil spill during maintenance exercise — contained, cleaned, no injury"
    },
    {
      "date": "Mar 14, 2026",
      "shortDesc": "Slip — wet floor near lab",
      "desc": "Slip on wet floor near lab entrance — no injury, area secured"
    }
  ],
